            "heading": "Cutting-Edge Laser Equipment",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Our laser-cutting services run on the latest technology, built to process both custom designs and high-volume runs with exceptional precision.</p><p><strong>Mazak OPTIPLEX FIBER III (10kW)</strong></p><ul><li>Fast, efficient fiber laser with the ability to cut up to 1¼” stainless steel and aluminum</li><li>Handles 1” mild steel at record speeds with reduced cost per part</li></ul><p><strong>Trumpf Lasers (2 units)</strong></p><ul><li>Versatile metal laser cutters capable of cutting 1” mild and stainless steel</li><li>Can process 0.625” aluminum and more</li></ul><p><strong>Trumpf RotoLas System</strong></p><ul><li>Designed for rotational cutting on tubes up to 10” diameter, making it ideal for custom piping and structural components</li></ul><p>With machines like these, we can deliver laser-cut parts that meet exact specifications, no matter how complex the shape or thick the material.</p>",
