            "heading": "Full-Service Fabrication Shop",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>EZG is more than a laser cutting company — we’re a full-service fabrication shop that handles over 90% of work in-house. That means faster communication, tighter tolerances, and better quality control from start to finish.</p><p>We support both custom projects and production runs, working with a variety of materials, including:</p><ul><li>Carbon steel</li><li>Stainless steel</li><li>Aluminum</li><li>Hastelloy and specialty metals</li></ul><p>From a single part to a high-volume laser metal order, EZG has the tools and people to get the job done right.</p>",
