          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Precision You Can Count On",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>When it comes to custom laser cutting, precision isn’t optional; it’s expected. With our industrial laser systems, we deliver reliable tolerances and consistent results that help our clients avoid delays and reduce rework. Whether you’re building a component for a high-stress environment or need a laser cut detail for a personal project, our laser cutters are calibrated to meet your expectations.</p><p><strong>Laser Plate Cutting Capacity:</strong></p><ul><li>Max Thickness: Up to 1” (25.4 mm)</li><li>Max Width: 76” (1930.4 mm)</li><li>Max Length: 154” (3911.6 mm)</li></ul><p>No matter the material or cut pattern, our team delivers high quality, custom metal parts with the accuracy that modern industry demands.</p>",
            "desktop_content_position": "start-md",
            "desktop_content_alignment": "ta-left-md top-md",
            "desktop_column": "2",
