            "description": "<p>At EZG, we’re solution-oriented from start to finish. We can work from your custom designs, help optimize part geometry for better cutting efficiency, or assist with material selection to suit your project’s demands. Whether you provide your own material or rely on our in-house inventory, our team is here to help.</p><p>Have a custom laser cutting request? Need help cutting thicker materials or unusual profiles? Just ask. A knowledgeable staff member will walk you through your options and provide accurate lead times for your next project.</p>",
